summary: A short summary.
fact-label: The fact
source: Demo source.

This is the **fact-box** content with some *bold* and *italic* text.

---

<!-- lwp:slide:series-nav -->

---

<!-- lwp:slide:full-article -->
article: first_article.md
'''

    demo1_article = '''# First article — full article

