- Another item

## II. An image with a caption

![A demo figure](img/demo-figure.svg "A captioned image — small, centered, themed (see §6.1)")

## References

[^1]: Demo source, 2025.
'''

    demo_figure_svg = '''<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="240" height="120" viewBox="0 0 240 120">
  <rect x="4" y="4" width="232" height="112" rx="10" fill="#e8e8e0" stroke="#3a3a44" stroke-width="2"/>
  <text x="120" y="68" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="28" fill="#3a3a44">LWP</text>
</svg>
'''

    # Article 2: middle — only page_title and card_label set; card_title/
    # card_desc and nav_title/nav_desc are left to cascade from page_title
    # and the cover slide's own summary (§20.3.1). series.json below
    # overrides THIS card_label with a different value, to demonstrate
    # series.json winning over an already-present meta value, not just an
    # absent one.
    demo2 = '''<!-- lwp:meta -->
